Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why him, of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was Father thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving a man of unknown\Nlineage the Black Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was from back when\NFather was an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and the Sovereign\NSix had pushed deep into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the darkest corner of\Nthe Dungeon of the Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a long and dangerous quest that,\Nupon exiting, yielded a prime dungeon relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Blade is the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Made of an unknown material\Nharder than mithril
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or a calcium or even\Nmonometal no matter the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,technique or skill used\Nnothing can cause even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a scratch upon it it\Nhas become known as the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unbreakable blade the\Nbiggest question is given
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its resilience how could\Nsuch an indestructible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,material gotten so\Nbeaten up that sword has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,value beyond that of a\Nweapon how could he just?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let such a thing go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm thinking about this wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father has also noticed the sense of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unrest hanging over the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.73,0:01:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, he is\Nputting his faith in that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who defeated a rampaging\Nminotaur and saved Lin's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might very well be\Nour secret weapon for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.07,0:01:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever is sure to happen in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, Lynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you be seen out here in public? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.43,0:01:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First and foremost, I am an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking we should go\Nto the guild after we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds terrific, instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really not the type\Nof guy who should be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,considered capable enough\Nof instructing Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.15,0:01:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did everything get so complicated?\NAnd she just follows me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everywhere all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I get some real work from the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll finally be able to\Ngrasp how clueless I am
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out there and drop this\Nwhole instructor nonsense?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.29,0:02:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a befitting task soon, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.89,0:02:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For every moment, the truth is not\Nallowed to be able to afford anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.79,0:02:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I have for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I have for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it away from my heart,\Nbut I will never be able to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.27,0:03:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it is a dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor, why are you here\Nwith Lady Lindbergh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an adventurer, I go by the name Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to add any titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:03:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's all this, Noor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anything else happen to you yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, uh, it's kind of\Ndifficult to explain. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, one of our rules is not sticking\Nyour nose where it doesn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was hoping he'd give me some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what brings you in today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that two people can do, if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A two-person job, huh? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I remember correctly,\Nyou're Silver B-Ring, right? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two form a party together, you\Ncan take on the goblin hunting job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the outskirts of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goblin hunting job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblins are the monsters\Nthat adventurers all over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world fight to put\Ntheir skills to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, sir, can we really take\Non an adventure like that? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.31,0:05:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn can accept silver tasks\Nlike this all on her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but bringing along a partner like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a lower rank than\Nhers is a big liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, the job will drop\Ndown a rank or two, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this! A quest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means I'm completely taking\Nadvantage of Lin's adventurer rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let's be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until now, all I've wanted\Nis for her to go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sees right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.11,0:05:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a scumbag, and she knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, she does still want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.11,0:05:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, what's wrong, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm relying solely on your rank to\Ntake on this goblin hunting job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm okay with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do for\Nyou, just say the word, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:06:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do feel kind of bad for\Nusing her status to get ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, one of my lifelong\Ndreams is finally coming true!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I haven't told you where\Nyou're going or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.37,0:06:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you want to take it anyway, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't go nuts out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A low threat level doesn't mean that\Nit's easy peasy, okay? Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of my limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to this area here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only report what you catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Forest of Beast. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right ear will be the\Nproof of your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be getting paid without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be sure to bring it back. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.09,0:06:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring back the right ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there have been reports of their\Nnumbers diminishing quite a bit lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't come across one, then go\Nahead and pick some medicinal herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go on, get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:06:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm serious, don't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adventure onward! Right! Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we are in the Forest of the Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trees are getting\Npretty dense, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are different types of plants than\Nwhat we see in the southern forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gargantuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ecological system here is very unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn, what kind of\Ncreatures are goblins? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'd like to at least\Nhear about them beforehand. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally they hunt small animals as prey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And eat the fruits off trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they've been attacking\Nhumans for sustenance lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we leave them be,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their numbers grow too large which leads\Nto a food shortage which in turn would
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.19,0:08:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,overflow into human villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why adventurers\Nare regularly dispatched
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to hunt them and control their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.65,0:08:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The health of the ecological\Nsystem of the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,actually depends on\Nwhether or not there are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goblins, which means we don't want\Nto hunt them to extinction either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, this forest has rare flora and\Nfauna that are not found in other places,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's Sometimes used for training,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for beginner adventurers\Nto forage and hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only does Lynn have the skills,\Nshe knows all sorts of... stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I possibly teach this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afraid not? None here? Either?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances, we would\Nhave encountered a few of them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose the rumors\Nabout the goblin numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dwindling are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting something from\Na creature to the northwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pinpoint its location.\NSo we found one? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.05,0:09:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't take too\Nmuch time to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.51,0:09:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It keeps getting darker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some extremely\Nold trees in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes it hard for the\Nsun to shine through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblins are known to\Nprefer a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course they would.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.37,0:09:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The presence of a monster was right\Nup ahead, but all of a sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters are living beings like us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think that they can maybe\Njust die from illness or old age?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, I guess that\Ncould be a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.19,0:10:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.71,0:10:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncover!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.15,0:10:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.77,0:10:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.21,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:11:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's a goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way bigger than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.21,0:11:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're said to be one of the weakest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's a huge difference in hearing\Nabout it and meeting one face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gnarly beast has all\Nthe calling cards green.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,skin walking on two legs\Npiercing glowing eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they use tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet all you higher-ranked adventurers\Nhandle these guys like they're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she's freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.11,0:11:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may be blessed with abilities but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has very little\Nactual combat experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only up against a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrifying, but worry about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.91,0:12:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's the Goblin Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A subspecies of the Goblin King,\Nconsidered an extreme threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Goblin Emperor is a beast created\Nfrom genetic manipulation by mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the deviant research that brought forth\Nthis forbidden knowledge is now banned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.91,0:12:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of that, this\None eats its own kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ingesting their power and\Ngrowing even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.37,0:12:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only up against a goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Nor come here because of this goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so excited to take\Non this job because he
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wanted to eliminate a threat\Nno one else knew about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.69,0:13:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to corner me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I ain't gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full windcutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Icicle dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it could be so quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry! Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goblin emperors shouldn't be\Nable to recover so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it! Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone on its forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can get that off, we can defeat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was watching how many I could handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't block them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Windblast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's constantly replenishing\Nits power with the monostone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we keep fighting like this, we're going\Nto run out of both stamina and magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if your magic attacks aren't\Nable to hit them and keep them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing I can do is going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you aim that attack at my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.45,0:15:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean windblast? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That move is powerful enough\Nto demolish Castle Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't possibly want me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have this to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.57,0:16:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only chance of getting\Nout of here is to be faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go. Let her rip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full weight loss. Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feather steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.37,0:16:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.77,0:17:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lynn, can you be the one to finish it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please don't let it suffer\Nany more than it already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.69,0:17:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hellfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hellfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll refrain from any more\Ngoblin slaying for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was way overconfident and got\Ninto too many dangerous situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to do a lot more training\Nbefore taking on the next challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it was a goblin emperor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been quite powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this size monostone,\Nit's larger than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the reports, it was\Nseveral times the size of a goblin king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The size is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.11,0:18:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Magic Empire may be\Nresponsible for the event itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, this stone, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We think, sir, it could be a demon's\Nheart from the holy theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:18:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is Lin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only minor wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been a terribly hard battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing they were able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster itself hid\Nbehind a powerful seal
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.03,0:19:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ambushed them in the forest of beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lady believes it had\Nbeen there a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in fact, maybe even\Nmore than that. A few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this seal is one that not even\Nthe secret core can perceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how are they transporting such a bulky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing all the way here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they use summoning magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.27,0:19:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sensory network in the\Ncapital should have caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.83,0:19:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did nothing show up in the perimeter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The number of goblins was decreasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the Adventurer's Guild\Nrequested an investigation into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There may have been several similar\Ncases in other areas as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This report is a summary of questionable\Ninstances from the last three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.07,0:19:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continue with the inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought that the little runt from
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way back when would\Ngrow up to slay goblins?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so much nastier\Nthat I thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Lynn came in at the last moment and we\Nmanaged to get the job done. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, that's not how it went
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happened my very first\Nhunt I should celebrate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it may be just another\Nquest to other adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to me this is you know\Neverything you did well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best to just watch from the\Nsidelines and let her handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I guess probably it's\Nthe wiser choice, too, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just grateful I got to\Nhelp her out a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where I'd be\Nif Lynn hadn't been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one that just\Nhelped you out, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.57,0:20:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, even goblins can still be a\Nthreat to newbies from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was a good\Nexperience for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly, it certainly was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I saw one in real life, I had no\Nidea goblins were anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who knew about the stone on\Nits forehead being a weak point?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stone on the forehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kind of a shiny reddish color.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And kind of pretty, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean a monostone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's normally buried in\Nthe heart or the throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.89,0:21:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that was\Nreally a goblin, my boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goblin, right? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you say it is, instructor,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then that is that, no\Nmatter what anybody says.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.17,0:21:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might have been a rare type, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's see\Nthe proof of the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to bring back the right ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, we might have set that goblin on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.27,0:21:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.47,0:22:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.53,0:23:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!

